-05-24T10:04:30Z","updated_at":"2025-05-24T10:04:30Z","body":"@Calinou I'm finding the FPS cannot be limited at all in the editor now under linux/wayland (I built the latest master branch at 45fc515)... both the vsync and max FPS setting are ignored in any combination I've tried so the editor just runs at hundreds of FPS and makes the GPU fan sound like a jumbo jet.\n\nN.b. should there not be a separate fps limit for the editor itself anyway? You might want the game itself to run at high framerates but could save a lot of energy / fan noise by running the editor at 30fps or even 20fps if you're just using it for scene building.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906731950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906894098","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106747#issuecomment-2906894098","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106747","id":2906894098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tQ68S","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-24T15:33:04Z","updated_at":"2025-05-24T15:33:24Z","body":"> N.b. should there not be a separate fps limit for the editor itself anyway?\n\nThere is one, but it's part of low-processor mode (so it won't work when **Update Continuously** is enabled in the Editor Settings). To reduce the maximum FPS, increase **Low Processor Mode Sleep Usec** in the Editor Settings (use `33333` for 30 FPS).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906894098/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]